title Checkout and Shipping
level design
actor Customer [80, 300]
command Place Order [250, 300]
aggregate Order [450, 290] (id agg_order_place)
event Order Placed [660, 300]
policy When an order is placed, ship it [860, 300]
command Ship Order [1070, 300]
aggregate Order [1270, 290] (id agg_order_ship)
event Order Shipped [1480, 300]
actor Warehouse Clerk [1120, 265] (on Ship Order)
readmodel Order Status [660, 120]
readmodel Shipping Dashboard [1480, 120]
external Payment Provider [450, 520]
