hotspot Double charge on retry? [860, 520]
note Design-level session: checkout flow and shipping [250, 120] (size 260x90)
Customer -> Place Order
Place Order -> #agg_order_place
Place Order -> Payment Provider
#agg_order_place -> Order Placed
Order Placed -> Order Status
Order Placed -> When an order is placed, ship it
When an order is placed, ship it -> Ship Order
Ship Order -> #agg_order_ship
